n_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_AttractGiver","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_GIRL_1","source_id":2,"local_id":2,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["My feelings toward my POKéMON… The attraction runs deep…\nOh, hi, you didn't see that, did you? Well, it doesn't matter.\nHow would you like this TM for your POKéMON?"]},{"at":[9,7],"source_script":"VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_Boy1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BOY_3","source_id":3,"local_id":3,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["What kind of moves have you taught your POKéMON?\nI think you would give yourself an advantage if they knew how to heal or protect themselves."]},{"at":[1,8],"source_script":"VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_Boy2","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BOY_2","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["If it doesn't like a certain move, a POKéMON will be reluctant to use it.\nIt doesn't matter how strong it is, either.\nFor example, a POKéMON with a GENTLE nature probably won't enjoy hurting its opponents.\nIf it can't seem to live up to its potential, it's probably failing at using a disliked move against its will."]},{"at":[12,6],"source_script":"VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_Scott","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_VERDANTURF_TOWN_SCOTT","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SCOTT","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"left","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":true,"name":"居民","lines":["SCOTT: Hey there, 小悠! I thought I might see you here.\nA BATTLE TENT's a place where you can meet tough TRAINERS.\nIt doesn't matter what the rules are, or how battles are waged, either.\n小悠, I expect you to do the best you can!"]},{"at":[2,8],"source_script":"VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_LittleBoy","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LITTLE_BOY","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"","facing":"left","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["My big sister is gentle usually. But when she gets angry, she's really, really scary!\nI bet a gentle POKéMON will be scary if it gets angry!"]}],"objects":[{"at":[4,5],"source_script":"VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_EventScript_RulesBoard","kind":"sign","native_fixture":true,"text":""}],"warps":[{"at":[6,9],"trigger":"down","to":{"region":"hoenn","map":"hoenn_verdanturf","at":[3,8],"hoenn_native":true,"arrival_from":[3,7],"facing":"down"},"source_warp":0},{"at":[7,9],"trigger":"down","to":{"region":"hoenn","map":"hoenn_verdanturf","at":[3,8],"hoenn_native":true,"arrival_from":[3,7],"facing":"down"},"source_warp":1}],"coord_events":[],"allow_running":false,"allow_cycling":false}
